@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft JhengHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 24
skinparam backgroundColor #FBFCFE
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #E7EFF5
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #123D65
skinparam ArrowColor #123D65
hide footbox
participant main
participant "工作A" as A
participant "工作B" as B
main -> main : 印「開始模擬列印」
main ->> A : a.start()
main ->> B : b.start()
note over A, B
  各自 1 → 2 → 3 後結束
  跨工作不要求交替
end note
main -> main : a.join() 等 A 終止
main -> main : b.join() 等 B 終止
main -> main : 正常等完才印「兩項工作皆已結束」
@enduml
